Z||000000||FieroMaster88||08-07-2001||09:36 PM||||Well...we finally did it.  Our family has a cable modem.  I set up the netwrok in the house this evening...and wow, everything works the first time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   So now everyone will get to see me around here more often.  YAY!!!!<P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">          <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6:D||||reg||6
Z||000001||loafer87gt||08-07-2001||10:33 PM||||Be sure to grab zone alarm or blackice now that you have a permanent net connection. You wouldn't believe how many people (on @home anyways) scan your machine for an open port to mess with it during the day. I am using ZoneAlarm now and really like it. It even has an internet lock you can engage when you aren't surfing the net that does the same as physically disconnecting your modem. Enjoy the speed, you gotta try Quake with your new low ping, its a blast<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_11.jpg">      <BR><FONT SIZE="1">87 Pontiac Fiero GT<BR>72 Volkswagon Van<P>"Hard work has a future<BR>payoff.  Laziness pays off now"</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroMaster88||08-07-2001||10:40 PM||||Our router has a built in fire wall...so hopefully i wont have any problems.  If I do, I will have to do soomething.  Man, I can wait to play some online Counter strike, or age of empires 2.  Should be tons of fun.  Something to do when I have no money left to put stuff on the fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">          <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6:D||||reg||1
Z||000003||DecadenceR||08-07-2001||11:29 PM||||I have a built in firewall too. but they still get through it. Trust me. You definitely want that Zone Alarm. And congrats on your new modem. You'll LOVE it.||||reg||1
